f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Dimmit County record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. March to April came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 17% of normal in September to October and 7% in October to November. Grid 10023 had its driest year in 1956, at 39% of normal.</p>"}
